sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as 客户端
  participant API as 任务 API
  participant Queue as 任务队列
  participant Worker as 处理器
  participant Store as 结果存储
  Client->>API: 提交任务
  API->>Queue: 任务入队
  Queue-->>API: 已接收
  API-->>Client: 202 与任务号
  Queue->>Worker: 交付任务
  Worker->>Worker: 处理任务
  Worker->>Store: 写入结果
  Worker-->>Queue: 确认消费
  Client->>API: 按任务号查询
  API->>Store: 读取状态与结果
  Store-->>API: 返回结果
  API-->>Client: 展示结果
